{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Independent non-author per-block review receipt. Reviewer session: agent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22. Basis dcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d; merged final commit 0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379. I independently read each before/after prose block against this ticket's contract, checked the immutable and final word counts, and verified normalized executable AST and non-allowlisted comment/directive preservation on the impacted files. All listed rows pass semantic preservation and bloat removal; lifecycle directive verdicts also pass.\n\n```tsv\nstable_block_id\tbefore_citation\tfinal_citation\tpreserved_contract_or_consumer\tdirectives_exact\tbefore_words\tafter_words\tsemantic_preservation\tbloat_removal\treviewer_session\r\ntests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_atomic_completion_close.py#D:_run_git\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_atomic_completion_close.py#D:_run_git\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_atomic_completion_close.py#D:_run_git\tpytest: Surface captured Git stderr on failure; CalledProcessError alone loses Git's diagnosis.\tPASS\t35\t11\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_caused_by_autoderive.py#D:<module>\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_caused_by_autoderive.py#D:<module>\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_caused_by_autoderive.py#D:<module>\tpytest: Interface coverage for explicit and blame-derived caused_by on bug close. The library and CLI must write a link through the closed-source path; this file owns single-culprit and ambiguous-blame cases.\tPASS\t102\t29\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_caused_by_autoderive_heldout.py#D:<module>\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_caused_by_autoderive_heldout.py#D:<module>\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_caused_by_autoderive_heldout.py#D:<module>\tpytest: Held-out caused_by coverage: the library close facade writes the link, and the user guide advises a blame hunt. The companion file owns the single-culprit and ambiguous-blame cases.\tPASS\t64\t27\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_claim_transition_parent_cascade.py#D:test_every_table_edge_cascades_through_the_real_transition\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_claim_transition_parent_cascade.py#D:test_every_table_edge_cascades_through_the_real_transition\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_claim_transition_parent_cascade.py#D:test_every_table_edge_cascades_through_the_real_transition\tpytest: Every live cascade-table edge must move the parent first through rebar.transition, so adding a table row creates a real interface case.\tPASS\t144\t22\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_claim_transition_parent_cascade.py#D:test_reactivate_child_reactivates_closed_parent\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_claim_transition_parent_cascade.py#D:test_reactivate_child_reactivates_closed_parent\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_claim_transition_parent_cascade.py#D:test_reactivate_child_reactivates_closed_parent\tpytest: Reactivating a closed child must reactivate its closed parent before the child enters progress.\tPASS\t45\t14\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_close_does_not_compact_barbet.py#D:<module>\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_close_does_not_compact_barbet.py#D:<module>\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_close_does_not_compact_barbet.py#D:<module>\tpytest: Closing a ticket writes status without compacting its event log. Compaction remains optional and explicit; tests inspect stored artifacts, state, and lock overlap rather than timing.\tPASS\t217\t26\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_close_does_not_compact_barbet.py#D:test_close_never_holds_the_lock_across_a_fold\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_close_does_not_compact_barbet.py#D:test_close_never_holds_the_lock_across_a_fold\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_close_does_not_compact_barbet.py#D:test_close_never_holds_the_lock_across_a_fold\tpytest: While close holds the store lock, no fold snapshot may appear. This checks the forbidden state without a timing budget.\tPASS\t126\t20\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_close_symbolic_ref_pins_3e21.py#D:<module>\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_close_symbolic_ref_pins_3e21.py#D:<module>\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_close_symbolic_ref_pins_3e21.py#D:<module>\tpytest: A symbolic close --ref is resolved once and pinned through verification and signing. A concurrent fetch may advance origin/main, but it must not change the close's basis or leave a successful close unsigned.\tPASS\t171\t34\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_exit_codes.py#D:<module>\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_exit_codes.py#D:<module>\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_exit_codes.py#D:<module>\tpytest: The CLI exit-code contract is pinned to docs/exit-codes.md: 0 success, 1 runtime or gate failure, 2 usage or terminal indeterminate, 10 concurrency, and 11 retryable gate degradation. validate retains its 0-4 health scale.\tPASS\t198\t35\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_exit_codes.py#D:_documented_subcommands\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_exit_codes.py#D:_documented_subcommands\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_exit_codes.py#D:_documented_subcommands\tpytest: Read per-command names from the documentation table in document order; avoid a duplicate command list.\tPASS\t37\t15\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_exit_codes.py#D:test_every_live_route_is_documented_and_every_doc_row_names_a_real_route\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_exit_codes.py#D:test_every_live_route_is_documented_and_every_doc_row_names_a_real_route\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_exit_codes.py#D:test_every_live_route_is_documented_and_every_doc_row_names_a_real_route\tpytest: Compare route membership in both directions: each live route appears in the table, and each table row begins with a live top-level route. Nested invocations share that route.\tPASS\t156\t28\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_force_unification_blusterous.py#D:<module>\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_force_unification_blusterous.py#D:<module>\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_force_unification_blusterous.py#D:<module>\tpytest: Claim and transition share force=<reason> across CLI and library. A bare flag records the same placeholder, --reason stays a close disposition, and removed force_close or boolean force inputs fail clearly.\tPASS\t131\t31\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_dependency_invalidation_790c.py#D:<module>\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_dependency_invalidation_790c.py#D:<module>\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_dependency_invalidation_790c.py#D:<module>\tpytest: Review and sign-review must reject changed subject or dependency material while ignoring unrelated writes. Own-material drift cancels a running review; transient signing failure alone points to sign-review recovery.\tPASS\t221\t28\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_dependency_invalidation_790c.py#D:test_review_plan_own_material_change_cancels_mid_run\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_dependency_invalidation_790c.py#D:test_review_plan_own_material_change_cancels_mid_run\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_dependency_invalidation_790c.py#D:test_review_plan_own_material_change_cancels_mid_run\tpytest: Own-material drift cancels before later passes and leaves an unsigned INDETERMINATE with no sidecar; dependency drift still reaches the signing guard.\tPASS\t87\t21\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_gate.py#C:1288-1302\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_gate.py#C:1288-1302\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_gate.py#C:1288-1302\tpytest: importable third-party symbols veto false absence findings in the full pipeline\tPASS\t137\t37\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_gate.py#C:1347-1354\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_gate.py#C:1347-13