y#D:<module>\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_gate.py#D:<module>\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_gate.py#D:<module>\tpytest: The optional claim gate performs a local signature check on claim and open-to-progress transitions. Review runs separately; missing, stale, or blocked reviews cannot certify, while the audited force path and exempt ticket types keep their documented behavior.\tPASS\t172\t37\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_gate.py#D:_GroundingVerifierFake\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_gate.py#D:_GroundingVerifierFake\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_gate.py#D:_GroundingVerifierFake\tpytest: Re-ground cited symbols through the real oracle. A refuted absence is vetoed; a genuinely absent symbol retains a blocking verification.\tPASS\t56\t20\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_gate.py#D:_capture_review_plan_kwargs\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_gate.py#D:_capture_review_plan_kwargs\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_gate.py#D:_capture_review_plan_kwargs\tpytest: Record the real CLI parser's review_plan arguments by replacing the module attribute at call time.\tPASS\t48\t15\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_gate.py#D:test_local_source_review_leaves_the_claim_gate_blocked\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_gate.py#D:test_local_source_review_leaves_the_claim_gate_blocked\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_gate.py#D:test_local_source_review_leaves_the_claim_gate_blocked\tpytest: A local-source review may pass but cannot sign or authorize a claim.\tPASS\t30\t12\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_gate.py#D:test_no_signed_attestation_can_carry_a_null_verified_at_sha\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_gate.py#D:test_no_signed_attestation_can_carry_a_null_verified_at_sha\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_gate.py#D:test_no_signed_attestation_can_carry_a_null_verified_at_sha\tpytest: Every signed review must name the committed tree it verified.\tPASS\t48\t10\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_gate.py#D:test_sign_review_recovery_binds_a_committed_verified_at_sha\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_gate.py#D:test_sign_review_recovery_binds_a_committed_verified_at_sha\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_gate.py#D:test_sign_review_recovery_binds_a_committed_verified_at_sha\tpytest: Recovered signatures must carry a committed verified-at-sha pin.\tPASS\t38\t8\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_gate.py#D:test_sign_review_refuses_to_resign_a_local_source_pass\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_gate.py#D:test_sign_review_refuses_to_resign_a_local_source_pass\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_plan_review_gate.py#D:test_sign_review_refuses_to_resign_a_local_source_pass\tpytest: sign-review must reject a local-source PASS sidecar, even through the recovery path.\tPASS\t49\t12\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_ref_coherence.py#C:199-202\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_ref_coherence.py#C:199-202\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_ref_coherence.py#C:199-202\tpytest: unresolved attested gate basis fails closed\tPASS\t19\t12\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_ref_coherence.py#C:68-72\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_ref_coherence.py#C:68-72\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_ref_coherence.py#C:68-72\tpytest: legacy working-tree attestation remains verifiable under the no-null-pin signing policy\tPASS\t44\t20\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_ref_coherence.py#D:<module>\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_ref_coherence.py#D:<module>\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_ref_coherence.py#D:<module>\tpytest: Plan review hashes dependencies at its pinned snapshot; the claim gate rechecks them at the current gate ref through the same basis resolver. Committed scoped drift stales, while local or unrelated changes do not; local-source mode uses the working tree.\tPASS\t132\t40\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_ref_coherence.py#D:test_attested_claim_gate_refuses_to_certify_when_the_gate_ref_is_unresolvable\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_ref_coherence.py#D:test_attested_claim_gate_refuses_to_certify_when_the_gate_ref_is_unresolvable\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_ref_coherence.py#D:test_attested_claim_gate_refuses_to_certify_when_the_gate_ref_is_unresolvable\tpytest: An attested gate whose configured ref cannot resolve must fail closed instead of substituting a matching working tree.\tPASS\t60\t18\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_ref_coherence.py#D:test_pre_s4b_attestation_still_verifies_when_the_gate_ref_is_unresolvable\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_ref_coherence.py#D:test_pre_s4b_attestation_still_verifies_when_the_gate_ref_is_unresolvable\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_ref_coherence.py#D:test_pre_s4b_attestation_still_verifies_when_the_gate_ref_is_unresolvable\tpytest: A legacy signature without a committed pin legitimately uses working-tree hashes, so an unresolvable gate ref must not reject it.\tPASS\t97\t20\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\r\ntests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_transition_reason_honest_3803.py#D:<module>\tdcb35ce77fecb1d60e5ca00d2f875245a9dc820d:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_transition_reason_honest_3803.py#D:<module>\t0d3393cdcaa023fb8c92f46e773c0eae1566a379:tests/interfaces/lifecycle/test_transition_reason_honest_3803.py#D:<module>\tpytest: Transition accepts --reason only where the close class records it. Plain transitions reject it; obsolete and wontfix require it, while force audit text comes from --force=<reason>. The blocked edge isolates flag behavior from claim and close gates.\tPASS\t245\t38\tPASS\tPASS\tagent:/root/review_group_01:2026-10-22\n```"},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1792731261782625172,"uuid":"e83c329e-9c00-4975-9f51-77753247f659"}